### Apps overlay / top bar in ERROR
- `St.ScrollView.set_child(St.Widget)` — must be `St.BoxLayout` (StScrollable)
- `Shell.BlurEffect` on the overlay
- `new AppLauncherOverlay()` not wrapped in try/catch (one throw blanks the whole panel)
- Edited live overlay but expected it without logout (except: ERROR state → enable reloads files)
- D-Bus name `org.peachos.AppLauncher` missing → dock script opens stock GNOME app grid
